 ## Subtopics
 
 ### [I2-SDF](18170-i2-sdf.md)
-I2-SDF is a neural implicit framework for complex indoor scenes that jointly recovers underlying shape, radiance, and material fields from multi-view images [18170-i2-sdf.md]. It distinguishes itself by decomposing the radiance field into spatially-varying material and emission components using surface-based, differentiable Monte Carlo raytracing, enabling physically based scene relighting and editing [18170-i2-sdf.md]. Unlike standard NeRF approaches that treat radiance as a monolithic field, I2-SDF employs a two-stage training scheme and error-guided adaptive sampling to resolve ambiguities and improve reconstruction quality on fine-grained small objects [18170-i2-sdf.md].
+I2-SDF is a neural implicit framework for complex indoor scenes that jointly recovers underlying shape, radiance, and material fields from multi-view images [I2-SDF](18170-i2-sdf.md). It distinguishes itself by decomposing the radiance field into spatially-varying material and emission components using surface-based, differentiable Monte Carlo raytracing, enabling physically based scene relighting and editing [I2-SDF](18170-i2-sdf.md). Unlike standard NeRF approaches that treat radiance as a monolithic field, I2-SDF employs a two-stage training scheme and error-guided adaptive sampling to resolve ambiguities and improve reconstruction quality on fine-grained small objects [I2-SDF](18170-i2-sdf.md).
 
